# The classic (non-BuildKit) layer cache depends on the context staying
# lean and stable: build state, git state, toolchains, and scratch never
# enter the tarball. Only the fastbuild stages receive the repo-root
# context (docker/Dockerfile.fastbuild); the docker-simulation context
# remains a script-assembled directory unaffected by this file.
/target
**/target
/.git
/.claude
/campaigns
/console
/.rocks
/build
/.lunet
/.tmp
/docs/site
/papers
